msgid "CMAKE_SYCL_DEVICE_TARGETS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SYCL_DEVICE_TARGETS.rst:7
msgid "Experimental. Gated by ``CMAKE_EXPERIMENTAL_SYCL``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SYCL_DEVICE_TARGETS.rst:9
msgid ""
"Default value of the :prop_tgt:`SYCL_DEVICE_TARGETS` target property.  See "
"that property for the supported compiler-specific values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SYCL_DEVICE_TARGETS.rst:12
msgid ""
"If set before first enabling SYCL, this variable also selects device targets "
"for compiler identification and testing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SYCL_DEVICE_TARGETS.rst:15
msgid ""
"For AdaptiveCpp, if this variable is not defined when SYCL is first enabled, "
"the default selection is taken from the :envvar:`ACPP_TARGETS` environment "
"variable, then :envvar:`HIPSYCL_TARGETS`, or the compiler's installation "
"default if neither environment variable is defined."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CMAKE_SYCL_DEVICE_TARGETS.rst:20
msgid "This variable is propagated into :command:`try_compile` projects."
msgstr ""
